{"id":"HumanWeb-cig","title":"Fix: Cobrowser cannot find LinkedIn Apply button (iframe/shadow DOM/timing)","description":"Root Cause: Extension uses document.querySelectorAll() and document.evaluate() which only search light DOM. LinkedIn's job detail pane loads asynchronously with Ember.js, and the Apply button may be in shadow DOM or not yet rendered when queried.\n\nFix needed:\n1. Add retry logic with wait for dynamically loaded content\n2. Add shadow DOM traversal support\n3. Add same-origin iframe traversal support\n4. Ensure element has valid geometry before returning coordinates","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"bug","created_at":"2026-01-02T17:28:04.002129702-08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-02T17:35:15.335129512-08:00","closed_at":"2026-01-02T17:35:15.335129512-08:00"}
