{"id":"HumanWeb-oet","title":"Command type mismatch: service sends command.get_page_info but extension expects command.getState","description":"The extension content.js handles 'command.getState' (line 248), but cobrowser_service.py and documentation refer to 'command.get_page_info'. This causes commands to timeout because the extension doesn't recognize the message type. Fix: Either rename the handler in content.js to command.get_page_info, or add an alias in background.js to translate get_page_info to getState.","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"bug","created_at":"2025-12-28T17:14:42.826259064-08:00","updated_at":"2025-12-28T17:21:32.149368485-08:00","closed_at":"2025-12-28T17:21:32.149368485-08:00"}
